{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:54 2026-10-10 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:54 2026-10-10 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:54 2026-10-10 HKT</p><p>今(10日)中午12時43分，油麻地上海街203號一間空置地舖，貓義工周小姐發現有數隻幼貓被困該舖的天井位置，一直未能離開，於是報警求助。消防接報到場，破門入舖，而愛護動物協會亦接獲通知，帶備捕貓網等拯救工具，最後成功救出3隻幼貓，幼貓約2至3個月大，為兄弟姊妹關係，屬本地短毛貓種，牠們並無表面傷痕，其後交予貓義工周小姐帶回貓舍照顧。</p><img alt=\"三隻貓沒有表面傷痕。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/284801de6913b2b71263ad3b7fd38782/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"幼貓約2至3個月大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/25c12b8ae12862410a7ca397a8f1f2e8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"三隻幼貓獲救。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2ad66e0e8d30d8efef1fa30f1efb8186/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_14_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"幼貓有親屬關係。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4a0636b70304ee3dc6106fddabcb21b8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場破門救貓。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/42deea86d1d1c98efbe3b394f1b08530/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"三幼貓被困空置店舖天井位置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2ec1d26230f9a8a7d53943e81d0b46ee/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_20.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e62799024fd9dbb74cf748b9fde65ad5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_19.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3d9a49f3109abcf8e29dc2f14451ce5f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_18_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"愛協人員到場協助救貓。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e01866821403b2e4cb8f410e2afbe8a1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_18_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"愛協人員帶同救貓網到場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ce52a71bad75287d6058bbaeb7d37e9a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_18.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"愛協人員救走幼貓。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8f22701cf9a6c8315942b9ef494bc727/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_16_1__0.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4fd853c00aa6adcc3682e5e0defcf3f2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_17.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貓義工在場協查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/afd52cbb9e970276ce927e7c09818c67/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-10_at_14_10_13_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T08:20:16.886760+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}